                             Installation

To install Bowling, copy Bowling.app to any directory (like \APP\) and
install it <Psion-I> from the system screen.  Alternatively, rename it
Bowling.img, and copy it to the \IMG\ directory, or any other directory
(such as a games alias) referenced by an alias of RunImg.


